+# Wire Format
+
+This project has no current recorded decision specifying a single wire serialisation format. The repository contains no policy, ADR, RFC, or other decision record designating one; the framework's documentation (`docs/doc.md`) describes JSON, XML, YAML, TOML, ProtoBuf, and MsgPack as supported, interchangeable rendering/binding options rather than a chosen standard, so nothing current is recorded here.
